  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Fulfill a VRF request with a BLS proof and oracle Ed25519 signature.\\n\\n# Checks-Effects-Interactions (CEI) pattern\\n1. **Checks**: validate oracle identity, proof, alpha seed, BLS signatures.\\n2. **Effects**: write `Fulfilled = true` and store proof BEFORE any external call.\\n3. **Interactions**: invoke consumer callback (if registered) only AFTER state\\nis fully committed, with a re-entrancy guard to block nested `fulfill()` calls.\\n\\n# Re-entrancy protection\\n`DataKey::Fulfilling(request_id)` is set to `true` before callback invocation\\nand cleared after. Any re-entrant call to `fulfill()` for the same request_id\\nwill see `Fulfilled = true` and panic with \"already fulfilled\".",
      "name": "fulfill",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "request_id",
          "type_": "u64"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "proof",
          "type_": {
            "udt": {
              "name": "BlsVrfProof"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "signature",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 64
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": []
    }
  },
